lor:#ffffff;border-bottom:3pt double #000;border-top:3pt double #000;padding:1.5pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr></table></div></ix:continuation><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;padding-left:9pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company individually evaluates nonaccrual loans when performing its CECL estimate to calculate the ACL. Additionally, the Company utilizes historical internal and third-party service provider sourced loss data in the determination of its PD/LGD rates applied in the calculation of its CECL estimate. Upon determination that a modified loan (or a portion of a loan) has subsequently been deemed uncollectible, the loan (or a portion of the loan) is charged off. Therefore, the amortized cost basis of the loan is reduced by the uncollectible amount and the ACL is adjusted by the same amount.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="height:42.75pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:36.765%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:29.309%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:30.626%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #dbdbdb;padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle"><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:232%">Eagle Bancorp, Inc Second Quarter 2026 Form 10-Q &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160; &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;               </span></div></td><td 